GCode dictionary _ Duet3D Documentation*
GCode meta commands _ Duet3D Documentation*
*:Zone.Identifier

# machine-owned files, never shipped with the config: sys/generated/ is written by the
# machine itself (nozzle, spool, filament diameter, bed surface, last filament
# temperature), sys/overrides/ holds the three versioned operator templates plus the
# printer name the image writes
sys/generated/
sys/overrides/printer-name.g

# local copy of the Duet3D wiki (https://github.com/Duet3D/wiki-content), G-code reference lookup
.duet-wiki/

# output tree of tools/gcode_crc.py, generated at deploy time
build/

# Python bytecode cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc
